NETWORK USE
-----------

AGPL-3.0 section 13 applies to this software. If you run a modified version
and let users interact with it over a network, you must offer those users the
corresponding source of your modified version. Deploying SignToROSS behind a
Cloudflare Tunnel, as the tooling in this repository is designed to do, is
exactly that case. Keep a public link to your source available from the running
service.
